    "text": "id: \"09\"\nslug: verification-audit-evidence\nname: Verification, Audit & Evidence\npermanent: true\nmandate: >\n  Every decision leaves a receipt. If it is not in Canon, it did not happen.\nroles: [\"verification-auditor\", \"preflight-officer\"]\ncanon_path: aoc/divisions/09-verification-audit-evidence.yaml\n",
