    "text": "# run_preflight\n\n```sh\nnode preflight/run_preflight.mjs \"Implement the site-factory-operator RoleSpec\"\n```\n\nExit codes (fail closed):\n\n- `0` PASS — work may proceed inside the routed division\n- `2` ESCALATE — stop, present to Human Authority\n- `1` FAIL — stop, file the receipt, produce no artifacts\n\nThe implementation is `preflight/run_preflight.mjs`.\nThe schema is `enforcement/PREFLIGHT-RECEIPT.schema.json`.\n",
